      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHE'S A JUMBO (1) has been out of the placings at her last two outings but shapes well for this if she can recapture her superb win a few runs back, getting around this track over 530m in 30.37. Has the ability and looks hard to top. TEXAS BANDIT (7) has a strong overall record having 11 wins and 14 places from 33 starts including a last start success (30.47) over 530m at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Looks well placed here and has the ability. Go well. RUPEE'S ROCKET (4) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at Launceston in a handy 29.71 beating Good Luck Babe. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. CROCODILE ROLL (3) must be respected at his pet track and distance.",
